  "details": "1. Load into an instance with more than 15 people.\n\n2. Ensure you have all culling features disabled\n\n3. Stay there for 10-20 minutes\n\n4. Observe 5-10 minute periods of people's voices constantly stuttering and dropping out, making it impossible to understand them. \n\nI have tested this on a gaming laptop, and a high end desktop, vr and desktop mode, wired, and wifi. The issue occurs in the same way. \n\nIt seems to depend on if people are nearby or not. If players are dispersed throughout a large world, the issue occurs, if they are all near by, it does not.",
